#6505
Caravan Road~
   You stand on a caravan road that winds through the desert. Warm breezes
blow across the sand, cooling your skin and making the desert seem less
desolate.
   The desert continues to the west, split only by this small road that
runs to the north and south and the city stables which lie to the east.
~
