#6677
Burning Sands~
   Sands shift and move in waves here as the strong desert winds pile the
burning grains into amorphous dunes. Beneath the moving dunes, a few desert
rodents leave raised paths that make the surface of the sands appear to be
alive with pulsing veins and arteries.
