Burning Sands~
   You stand parched amidst the shifting, searing sands of Xixieqi. A few
prickly pear cacti dot the sandy ground, offering some small amount of
protection for the snakes, scorpions, and desert rats that live beneath
the spiny leaves. The tall peaks of a large mountain range prevent travel
to the south.
